WEBVTT

01:41.050 --> 01:45.630
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.160 --> 01:50.830
[Episode 17]

01:57.920 --> 01:58.890
Huaizhu...

02:00.430 --> 02:01.230
is back.

02:28.810 --> 02:30.590
Dongfang Huaizhu.

02:31.350 --> 02:32.430
Jiuhuo,

02:33.420 --> 02:37.220
I'm not born for the Black Fox.

02:38.020 --> 02:40.350
You'll regret bringing me to the Sky City.

02:41.910 --> 02:43.520
What are you going to do?

03:25.260 --> 03:27.079
Pure Yang Flames...

03:28.360 --> 03:30.280
Dongfang Huaizhu!

03:31.700 --> 03:32.850
Jiuhuo,

03:36.320 --> 03:37.910
you are defeated.

03:52.890 --> 03:54.490
Hongye, you finally woke up.

03:58.079 --> 03:59.100
Where is Huaizhu?

04:00.900 --> 04:01.900
Where is Huaizhu?

04:08.190 --> 04:09.400
Where is Huaizhu?

04:12.080 --> 04:13.160
Where is Huaizhu?

04:28.890 --> 04:30.100
Did I lose?

04:40.480 --> 04:42.010
It's time to take medicine.

05:14.360 --> 05:17.290
Young Master Wangquan, it seems...

05:42.470 --> 05:43.470
Huaizhu,

05:46.310 --> 05:47.520
is that you?

05:50.210 --> 05:51.320
Yes, it's me,

05:59.600 --> 06:01.100
Dongfang Huaizhu.

06:07.750 --> 06:08.550
Hongye,

06:10.420 --> 06:12.630
we achieved a landslide victory.

06:16.430 --> 06:17.490
How is Mu Mie doing?

06:18.200 --> 06:20.980
He got injured and lost too much spiritual energy.

06:20.980 --> 06:22.660
But he should be fine.

06:22.690 --> 06:24.420
Miss Cuiyu is attending to him.

06:25.190 --> 06:27.750
When Quzhuo fixes the golden lotus,

06:27.750 --> 06:28.800
we can all go home.

06:29.510 --> 06:30.870
Hongye, how will

06:31.310 --> 06:32.800
you deal with Jiuhuo?

06:38.409 --> 06:39.890
Jiuhuo never dies.

06:41.070 --> 06:42.360
He was sealed once.

06:43.560 --> 06:45.420
We'll take him back to 20 years ago

06:46.310 --> 06:47.710
to have him sealed again.

07:09.890 --> 07:11.010
Huaizhu,

07:11.130 --> 07:13.340
I'm leaving Hongye to your care.

07:15.460 --> 07:17.070
Come on, Quzhuo.

07:17.070 --> 07:18.430
Do you fancy some fresh air?

07:18.430 --> 07:20.120
Come on. Let's go.

07:30.440 --> 07:31.740
Give me your hand.

07:38.150 --> 07:40.100
It is a bit cold.

07:47.000 --> 07:48.050
Warm it up then.

08:00.470 --> 08:01.800
Are you feeling better?

08:07.120 --> 08:08.360
These battles have

08:09.170 --> 08:11.090
given you severe injuries.

08:11.430 --> 08:13.870
You need attentive medical care back home.

08:18.670 --> 08:19.480
Huaizhu,

08:20.120 --> 08:21.410
I realized two things

08:22.000 --> 08:23.560
in this fierce battle.

08:24.420 --> 08:25.380
First,

08:25.660 --> 08:26.890
I owe you an apology.

08:27.060 --> 08:28.840
I'm sorry I didn't tell you

08:29.120 --> 08:32.669
my other identity, though I didn't mean to hide it.

08:33.080 --> 08:34.510
I was waiting for the right moment

08:34.510 --> 08:35.789
to reveal it.

08:39.669 --> 08:40.720
Second,

08:43.179 --> 08:44.700
I don't want to cancel

08:45.510 --> 08:46.840
our meeting on July 7th.

08:49.900 --> 08:51.450
At the Yang family's residence,

08:51.450 --> 08:54.020
I already bade farewell to you.

08:54.440 --> 08:56.190
Young Master Wangquan,

08:57.230 --> 08:58.350
please stop here.

09:00.380 --> 09:02.690
I won't see you at the Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai

09:02.690 --> 09:04.220
on July 7th!

09:07.030 --> 09:08.110
Are you saying

09:09.000 --> 09:10.270
that you only want to

09:10.410 --> 09:13.060
meet me once in a year

09:13.090 --> 09:14.130
on July 7th?

09:14.150 --> 09:15.190
Of course not.

09:21.980 --> 09:23.180
So you're teasing me.

09:32.820 --> 09:33.880
Take the medicine.

09:42.600 --> 09:43.740
Inside of me,

09:44.240 --> 09:45.600
some of the Black Fox's energy

09:45.600 --> 09:47.460
and soul fragments still remain.

09:47.820 --> 09:50.140
She was brutal and resourceful.

09:51.060 --> 09:52.660
If she had left the Boundary,

09:53.150 --> 09:54.950
there would've been a disaster.

10:02.510 --> 10:03.840
It's a sleepless night.

10:04.750 --> 10:06.150
Shall we go out for a walk?

10:07.360 --> 10:10.510
Let's see what the world is like after 20 years.

10:37.940 --> 10:40.150
I didn't expect this street to be so bustling

10:40.150 --> 10:43.280
because humans and demons are making prayers together.

10:44.600 --> 10:46.320
Humans and demons

10:46.790 --> 10:49.440
share the same aspirations.

11:15.750 --> 11:17.270
They are all looking for hope

11:17.270 --> 11:18.330
though in despair.

11:19.930 --> 11:22.260
They wish for a life of joy.

11:23.120 --> 11:25.210
Both humans and demons

11:27.150 --> 11:29.480
are making the best of what they're given.

11:56.920 --> 11:58.480
All is finally over.

12:00.290 --> 12:01.990
When Quzhuo fixes the lotus,

12:02.080 --> 12:03.430
we can go home.

12:04.090 --> 12:04.800
Young...

12:11.180 --> 12:12.070
Hongye,

12:15.960 --> 12:17.580
I have a question.

12:19.220 --> 12:20.370
What made you

12:21.400 --> 12:23.510
risk your life to save mine?

12:25.630 --> 12:27.230
I've never thought about it.

12:27.790 --> 12:31.510
What if the war had ended worse than you expected?

12:32.960 --> 12:36.500
I haven't thought about that either.

12:37.160 --> 12:39.020
Then what have you thought about?

12:39.190 --> 12:40.520
That I must not lose you.

12:55.060 --> 12:56.400
♪ Has there been a dream ♪

12:57.160 --> 13:00.660
♪ Where you cry and chase after someone's back? ♪

13:01.700 --> 13:05.730
♪ Your face is streaked with tears when you wake up ♪

13:07.600 --> 13:08.510
♪ Memories are like wind ♪

13:09.180 --> 13:10.700
♪ Traveling a long journey ♪

13:11.200 --> 13:13.150
♪ The sun sets and the moon rises ♪

13:13.800 --> 13:15.550
♪ You're a wavering candle flame ♪

13:16.310 --> 13:19.200
♪ Shedding light on our past ♪

13:20.010 --> 13:21.550
♪ How do I ♪

13:22.120 --> 13:23.400
♪ Tell you ♪

13:24.040 --> 13:25.510
♪ I love you? ♪

13:26.430 --> 13:27.790
♪ How do I ♪

13:28.380 --> 13:29.720
♪ Tell you how much ♪

13:30.260 --> 13:32.300
♪ I miss you? ♪

13:33.140 --> 13:35.870
♪ A parting is like a tree's growth ring ♪

13:36.570 --> 13:38.940
♪ The rings are trapping ♪

13:39.650 --> 13:43.910
♪ All the lovesick souls ♪

13:45.820 --> 13:48.180
♪ No words are needed when our eyes lock ♪

13:49.010 --> 13:51.190
♪ No words are needed when our souls connect ♪

13:51.920 --> 13:54.190
♪ Turn around, love is like falling petals ♪

13:55.150 --> 13:57.440
♪ How to grow roots? ♪

13:58.360 --> 14:01.060
♪ No words are needed when we brush shoulders ♪

14:02.000 --> 14:04.290
♪ It goes without saying that we yearn for each other ♪

14:05.080 --> 14:07.840
♪ We missed out on each other ♪

14:08.490 --> 14:11.720
♪ We're waiting for a reunion ♪

14:09.630 --> 14:11.870
The Sky City looks amazing at night.

14:15.550 --> 14:16.950
What beautiful scenery.

14:18.120 --> 14:20.120
The perfect time to drink, isn't it?

14:21.120 --> 14:22.750
You know me well, Yitan.

14:33.910 --> 14:34.910
Yitan,

14:34.910 --> 14:37.120
are we sharing a kiss

14:37.120 --> 14:38.800
by doing so?

14:43.440 --> 14:44.540
Are you okay?

14:45.010 --> 14:46.800
I-I-I'm fine.

14:49.630 --> 14:52.370
Don't we usually drink like this?

14:52.670 --> 14:53.660
Really?

14:53.890 --> 14:55.410
How come it feels

14:55.440 --> 14:57.670
particularly different to me today?

14:57.670 --> 14:58.930
Let me count the times.

14:59.330 --> 15:01.660
It first happened when we played with mud.

15:01.800 --> 15:03.360
The second time was in the Sky-breaking Temple,

15:03.360 --> 15:05.690
where we repeatedly did the same thing.

15:05.960 --> 15:07.080
Then when we carried out missions...

15:07.080 --> 15:07.790
Zui.

15:14.750 --> 15:17.440
Yitan, do you remember when we were little,

15:17.440 --> 15:20.080
my father held your hand like this

15:20.080 --> 15:21.750
and led you to me, saying

15:21.750 --> 15:23.750
that you would be my future husband?

15:35.050 --> 15:36.580
I remember that, of course.

15:36.810 --> 15:37.980
However,

15:38.510 --> 15:40.850
you secretly drank some home-brew rice wine

15:40.850 --> 15:42.590
that day and caused a scene.

15:42.710 --> 15:45.540
You chased, cursed and bit me.

15:45.570 --> 15:47.570
You also firmly refused to marry me.

15:49.000 --> 15:50.860
Silly childhood stuff, isn't it?

15:52.030 --> 15:53.120
Yitan,

15:53.750 --> 15:55.150
you always treat me well

15:55.720 --> 15:57.870
and give me a strong sense of security.

15:58.910 --> 15:59.870
Sometimes...

16:01.670 --> 16:03.630
It makes me wonder.

16:06.030 --> 16:07.320
About what?

16:08.090 --> 16:09.620
Do you love me?

16:24.910 --> 16:26.330
I certainly love you.

16:28.810 --> 16:30.670
Because you're my little sister!

17:22.109 --> 17:24.640
Quzhuo, why did you ask for a meeting?

17:27.400 --> 17:28.730
No reason.

17:30.070 --> 17:33.200
I just wanted to see you again

17:34.500 --> 17:35.760
after such a long time.

17:38.400 --> 17:40.400
You're bad at hiding your thoughts.

17:41.240 --> 17:42.440
Just speak your mind.

17:54.160 --> 17:55.030
I think...

17:59.400 --> 18:00.330
You're entitled

18:02.590 --> 18:04.450
to be informed of certain things.

18:14.320 --> 18:22.110
[For Hongye]
[From Huaizhu]

18:16.590 --> 18:19.830
These are the letters that Miss Huaizhu wrote

18:20.350 --> 18:22.200
to you after your passing.

18:24.030 --> 18:24.830
Huaizhu?

18:25.830 --> 18:28.640
She stayed within the Boundary after you left it.

18:31.270 --> 18:32.650
Every year on your death anniversary,

18:32.540 --> 18:40.600
[For Hongye]
[From Huaizhu]

18:33.160 --> 18:36.790
she would bring a letter to your cenotaph.

18:38.200 --> 18:40.030
I took the liberty

18:40.350 --> 18:41.930
of keeping all the letters.

18:45.250 --> 18:46.910
But there aren't many of them.

18:47.830 --> 18:48.640
Because

18:51.780 --> 18:54.240
in the 10th year after you left the Boundary,

18:57.420 --> 18:58.800
she passed away.

19:42.750 --> 19:43.670
Hongye,

19:44.370 --> 19:46.030
aren't you going to read them?

19:47.560 --> 19:48.350
No.

19:51.440 --> 19:52.490
I believe

19:53.710 --> 19:55.200
fate can be changed,

19:56.820 --> 19:58.350
and hope lies in the future.

20:00.200 --> 20:02.490
This cannot be the ending of my story

20:04.820 --> 20:06.310
with Dongfang Huaizhu.

20:32.310 --> 20:34.620
You're here to laugh at me.

20:35.040 --> 20:36.040
You already lost.

20:40.530 --> 20:42.330
You know clearly

20:42.360 --> 20:44.820
that the Black Grief Tree won't cease to be,

20:46.110 --> 20:48.610
and that Jia Lan will come back one day,

20:50.850 --> 20:54.380
as long as there are evil thoughts in the world.

20:54.530 --> 20:55.990
I certainly know all that.

20:56.590 --> 20:58.720
Evil thoughts will never be erased,

20:59.720 --> 21:01.120
no matter how hard we try.

21:02.400 --> 21:03.590
Are you dreaded?

21:10.640 --> 21:11.440
Similarly,

21:12.410 --> 21:14.200
you cannot block out the light.

21:14.550 --> 21:15.790
Just like now,

21:16.420 --> 21:17.510
the swords in our hands

21:17.510 --> 21:19.830
will pierce deeply into your chests,

21:19.830 --> 21:21.270
drowning you in fear.

21:21.270 --> 21:22.590
Even if we collapse,

21:23.240 --> 21:25.100
the future generations will know

21:25.590 --> 21:27.190
that you are not invincible.

21:27.920 --> 21:30.830
I believe, as long as there are sword wielders,

21:31.720 --> 21:34.720
the dawn light will eventually illuminate the world.

21:38.030 --> 21:38.880
No, it won't.

21:39.550 --> 21:42.640
I'll kill all the sword wielders before that.

21:45.110 --> 21:45.920
I...

21:47.310 --> 21:49.750
will kill you one day.

22:04.030 --> 22:05.590
Come on, Quzhuo.

22:06.310 --> 22:07.070
It's been long

22:07.070 --> 22:08.640
since we drank so happily.

22:08.640 --> 22:09.570
How delightful!

22:10.070 --> 22:11.870
I should be saying that instead.

22:13.410 --> 22:16.140
The drinks I had alone in the Sky-breaking Temple

22:17.510 --> 22:18.510
tasted bitter.

22:19.920 --> 22:20.780
To our reunion.

22:23.200 --> 22:24.260
And to our parting.

22:24.680 --> 22:26.070
To our reunion and parting.

22:26.070 --> 22:26.720
Cheers!

22:27.200 --> 22:27.660
Cheers.

22:27.920 --> 22:28.380
Cheers.

22:33.110 --> 22:36.830
If you really think about it, Jiuhuo is deeply infatuated.

22:37.000 --> 22:39.660
Though love drove him to choose a wrong path,

22:39.910 --> 22:41.510
he's not worthy of sympathy.

22:42.090 --> 22:43.940
You humans are ridiculous.

22:44.110 --> 22:46.110
I don't think he did anything wrong.

22:46.440 --> 22:48.900
As long as my beloved one feels free and happy,

22:48.900 --> 22:51.500
nothing else could bother me.

22:52.840 --> 22:54.160
It's never been easy to decide

22:54.160 --> 22:55.560
between love and morals.

22:55.750 --> 22:57.720
Let's drop the subject.

22:58.680 --> 23:00.860
Yes. In whatever way,

23:01.880 --> 23:02.810
he already lost.

23:02.830 --> 23:03.830
Hongye is right.

23:04.660 --> 23:06.040
Let's drink.

23:06.440 --> 23:06.900
Cheers!

23:07.000 --> 23:07.460
Cheers!

23:07.680 --> 23:08.140
Cheers!

23:08.440 --> 23:08.830
Cheers!

23:08.830 --> 23:09.290
Cheers!

23:09.440 --> 23:09.900
Cheers!

23:17.170 --> 23:18.970
This is your mother's favorite.

23:19.200 --> 23:20.030
Try it.

23:21.330 --> 23:23.130
Mom told me a lot about you,

23:23.160 --> 23:24.160
Auntie Huaizhu.

23:24.740 --> 23:27.400
You look just like your mother.

23:27.710 --> 23:28.600
Really?

23:28.830 --> 23:30.030
Come on, Mu Mie.

23:31.570 --> 23:33.430
You haven't fully recovered yet.

23:33.510 --> 23:35.350
I'll drink this on his behalf.

23:38.860 --> 23:40.980
Then the next turn will be mine.

23:49.110 --> 23:49.920
In fact,

23:52.310 --> 23:55.790
the golden lotus can be put into use soon.

23:58.740 --> 24:00.410
When it starts working,

24:02.830 --> 24:03.510
you all

24:05.000 --> 24:06.240
will be taken home.

24:08.240 --> 24:10.070
I'll be left alone here again.

24:14.510 --> 24:15.590
Quzhuo,

24:17.460 --> 24:18.900
didn't we make a promise?

24:18.920 --> 24:21.330
We will change the story,

24:21.360 --> 24:22.720
and we'll all stay alive.

24:22.720 --> 24:25.350
The Sky-breaking Temple won't be dull and quiet.

24:25.350 --> 24:27.120
There won't be misery either.

24:27.750 --> 24:29.720
Where there is a will...

24:32.330 --> 24:35.110
There is a way!

24:35.840 --> 24:36.750
Very good.

24:36.770 --> 24:38.570
The mischievous Quzhuo is back.

24:42.070 --> 24:42.880
Come on.

24:44.780 --> 24:46.640
To the two decade-ago Mask Group.

24:48.030 --> 24:50.160
To the two decade-later version of us.

24:50.250 --> 24:52.810
All the sorrows and pain

24:53.060 --> 24:54.190
will go away.

24:54.850 --> 24:55.570
Cheers.

24:56.000 --> 24:56.700
-Cheers!
-Cheers.

24:56.700 --> 24:57.110
Cheers.

24:57.110 --> 24:57.590
Cheers.

25:06.810 --> 25:07.330
Mu Mie!

25:37.130 --> 25:38.000
Miss Huaizhu,

25:38.030 --> 25:39.160
how is my brother?

25:42.960 --> 25:44.620
His organs are all shattered.

25:44.850 --> 25:46.050
So are his meridians.

25:47.320 --> 25:49.780
It resulted from the battle against Jiuhuo.

25:53.110 --> 25:54.310
That's impossible.

25:54.620 --> 25:56.070
He was fine just now.

25:56.070 --> 25:58.030
He said he had a minor stomachache,

25:58.030 --> 25:59.400
and that he was alright.

26:00.310 --> 26:03.400
Just like Mu Xiaowu,

26:04.680 --> 26:06.280
he withheld all the bad news.

26:06.570 --> 26:07.750
Is there a cure for him?

26:07.750 --> 26:10.210
Yeah. What medicine is needed?

26:10.830 --> 26:11.880
I'll try to get it.

26:16.680 --> 26:17.630
Miss Cuiyu,

26:18.110 --> 26:20.710
the Leech Clan is known for its medical skills.

26:21.400 --> 26:23.400
I can't think of a solution now.

26:24.030 --> 26:26.440
Will you please save his life?

26:31.720 --> 26:33.270
Prepare a room for me.

26:34.830 --> 26:36.230
Do not disturb me and him.

26:48.110 --> 26:50.240
I already failed to protect Mu Xiaowu.

26:52.590 --> 26:53.370
Now,

26:54.720 --> 26:56.780
will I also fail to protect Yan's son?

27:14.310 --> 27:15.070
Huaizhu,

27:15.680 --> 27:16.440
Yitan,

27:16.920 --> 27:18.380
don't beat yourselves up.

27:18.720 --> 27:20.070
We have all seen

27:20.070 --> 27:22.590
what Miss Cuiyu is capable of.

27:22.590 --> 27:25.030
Now, all we can do is wait.

27:55.240 --> 27:56.680
Miss Cuiyu.

28:12.790 --> 28:14.720
You know I'm unable to heal wounds.

28:16.070 --> 28:19.830
I can't perform any sort of demonic magic.

28:22.850 --> 28:23.820
Blue Eyes,

28:24.050 --> 28:25.570
come out now.

28:32.030 --> 28:33.090
Come out right now!

28:33.440 --> 28:35.240
Blue Eyes, I know you're here.

28:35.240 --> 28:36.310
Show up!

28:36.830 --> 28:39.030
Dummy will die without your help.

28:39.030 --> 28:39.790
He will die!

28:39.790 --> 28:41.000
Do you know that?

28:57.110 --> 28:58.170
What are you doing?

29:01.030 --> 29:02.920
It's high time you repaid me.

29:06.310 --> 29:08.320
You'll fall into eternal sleep

29:08.370 --> 29:10.050
and never wake up.

29:16.600 --> 29:17.790
We've been sharing

29:18.200 --> 29:20.150
one body over all this time.

29:21.880 --> 29:23.880
I've cast a spell on Blue Eyes

29:23.960 --> 29:26.160
and taken sole possession of this body.

29:27.510 --> 29:29.040
I can't wake her up anymore.

29:32.080 --> 29:34.330
If she is to come to,

29:35.110 --> 29:36.720
I'll have to disappear

29:37.440 --> 29:39.040
and give the body back to her.

29:40.200 --> 29:41.350
Only in this way

29:41.920 --> 29:43.400
can I save Dummy's life.

29:46.110 --> 29:48.960
Blue Eyes is the only one you love.

29:50.000 --> 29:52.400
I just stole her position, didn't I?

29:57.550 --> 29:58.960
Dummy,

29:59.550 --> 30:01.070
when did I

30:01.070 --> 30:02.640
fall in love with you?

30:07.920 --> 30:08.720
Perhaps

30:12.340 --> 30:15.230
it all started when I gave you wrong directions

30:15.890 --> 30:17.750
as you asked me like a little fool.

30:22.870 --> 30:25.140
What do I see in you, Dummy?

30:26.850 --> 30:29.120
You're silly and goofy.

30:34.040 --> 30:36.650
But I can't control my feelings for you.

30:39.160 --> 30:41.510
When I see you talking to another girl,

30:42.270 --> 30:43.400
I'd get mad.

30:44.800 --> 30:47.760
I want to yell at you every time your face appears.

30:51.920 --> 30:54.240
But why can't you understand

30:56.110 --> 30:57.200
that I yell at you

30:59.950 --> 31:02.690
only to hear you talk back to me?

31:05.110 --> 31:06.030
Dummy,

31:08.030 --> 31:08.920
I know

31:10.240 --> 31:12.240
I'm bossy and pushy.

31:13.030 --> 31:14.990
Sometimes, I'm a loose cannon.

31:18.550 --> 31:20.240
If I force you to be with me,

31:21.790 --> 31:23.510
you'll be upset, right?

31:33.750 --> 31:34.550
So,

31:35.960 --> 31:37.030
I have to leave.

31:38.310 --> 31:39.030
From now on,

31:40.360 --> 31:42.960
Blue Eyes, who you love, will keep you company,

31:43.750 --> 31:44.590
alright?

32:23.530 --> 32:24.800
Go back to sleep.

32:26.350 --> 32:27.460
Blue Eyes

32:28.780 --> 32:30.190
will be with you soon.

33:01.810 --> 33:04.020
♪ Moonlight paints the ground silver white ♪

33:04.930 --> 33:07.100
♪ Yet some stubborn soul holds it tight ♪

33:08.560 --> 33:10.740
♪ Mistaking it for the deepest sorrow ♪

33:11.610 --> 33:13.080
♪ That never fades ♪

33:14.810 --> 33:17.210
♪ Barren or bright, it's just the sea of the heart ♪

33:18.460 --> 33:22.180
♪ Love fades and blooms and starts again ♪

33:24.070 --> 33:26.410
♪ How many people can understand it? ♪

33:27.250 --> 33:29.950
♪ Flowers blossom and wither, again and again ♪

33:30.680 --> 33:33.180
♪ Like meeting once more, only to part again ♪

33:33.850 --> 33:35.430
♪ Time has already changed ♪

33:36.400 --> 33:41.230
♪ Yet we promise to wait ♪

33:43.950 --> 33:49.040
♪ Splitting the heart, offering love to the raging flames ♪

33:46.690 --> 33:49.460
I'll bring back the girl you like now.

33:50.500 --> 33:55.740
♪ Tears become the wind, stirring the world into daylight ♪

33:51.080 --> 33:51.880
But...

33:54.880 --> 33:56.970
Don't you ever forget about me.

33:56.740 --> 33:58.210
♪ Don't look back, keep walking ♪

33:58.960 --> 34:00.150
♪ Live or die, keep moving forward ♪

33:59.880 --> 34:02.270
You've always been the one I love.

34:00.810 --> 34:02.390
♪ Through the fire ♪

34:02.680 --> 34:03.400
Always,

34:03.440 --> 34:04.490
Red Eyes!

34:03.540 --> 34:06.250
♪ Whose love ♪

34:06.570 --> 34:07.470
What...

34:07.420 --> 34:09.650
♪ Could be wider than the universe? ♪

34:07.920 --> 34:09.120
What did you just say?

34:10.360 --> 34:12.940
♪ It's ours ♪

34:12.030 --> 34:13.940
I like how bossy you are.

34:16.719 --> 34:18.360
I like how outspoken you are.

34:19.320 --> 34:22.320
I appreciate your guts to speak your mind.

34:23.710 --> 34:25.219
You have no fears.

34:25.480 --> 34:27.120
You're untethered.

34:27.670 --> 34:29.230
You are the most

34:29.320 --> 34:31.610
free-spirited person I've seen.

34:33.710 --> 34:36.810
Although sometimes

34:36.920 --> 34:38.670
you can be a bit unreasonable,

34:40.770 --> 34:43.330
I've never ever hated you.

34:44.989 --> 34:46.520
I like it when you yell at me.

34:46.960 --> 34:49.070
I do mean to talk back,

34:49.190 --> 34:50.000
but I...

34:52.949 --> 34:54.159
I bite my tongue

34:56.230 --> 34:57.840
when I see your eyes.

34:58.800 --> 35:01.800
My heart would beat so fast

35:03.400 --> 35:05.630
that I can't speak

35:07.960 --> 35:10.760
anything I have in mind.

35:12.510 --> 35:16.480
You once asked me who I loved.

35:17.230 --> 35:18.920
You told me to think it over.

35:23.550 --> 35:25.010
But I didn't need to think.

35:26.730 --> 35:28.250
You're the one I love.

35:31.550 --> 35:33.160
You always are.

35:47.960 --> 35:49.510
It has been you all the time.

36:02.960 --> 36:03.840
Why?

36:08.410 --> 36:10.250
Why do good things

36:10.700 --> 36:12.940
♪ Barren or bright, it's just the sea of the heart ♪

36:12.120 --> 36:13.930
have to happen so late?

36:14.240 --> 36:17.940
♪ Love fades and blooms and starts again ♪

36:19.850 --> 36:22.020
♪ How many people can understand it? ♪

36:22.960 --> 36:25.380
♪ How time flies ♪

36:26.460 --> 36:28.600
♪ Mortals are like dust in the world ♪

36:28.590 --> 36:29.440
No.

36:29.300 --> 36:30.970
♪ It's all like a dream in retrospect ♪

36:30.840 --> 36:31.820
No!

36:31.860 --> 36:35.240
♪ Nothing can change our minds ♪

36:33.010 --> 36:35.340
Red Eyes, no...

36:36.270 --> 36:41.380
♪ Splitting the heart, offering love to the raging flames ♪

36:36.290 --> 36:38.640
Don't do this, Red Eyes.

36:38.960 --> 36:39.880
Red Eyes!

36:40.580 --> 36:42.100
Though this came late,

36:42.800 --> 36:48.040
♪ Tears become the wind, stirring the world into daylight ♪

36:43.860 --> 36:45.200
it's still good.

36:47.800 --> 36:48.800
Dummy,

36:48.890 --> 36:50.620
♪ Don't look back, keep walking ♪

36:50.330 --> 36:51.690
thank you for being the proof

36:51.190 --> 36:52.540
♪ Live or die, keep moving forward ♪

36:53.110 --> 36:54.800
♪ Through the fire ♪

36:53.610 --> 36:54.690
of me being alive

36:55.840 --> 36:58.550
♪ Whose love ♪

36:57.560 --> 36:58.770
and being loved.

36:59.720 --> 37:01.920
♪ Could be wider than the universe? ♪

37:02.660 --> 37:07.160
♪ It's ours ♪

37:06.840 --> 37:07.690
No.

37:10.480 --> 37:12.890
No!

37:15.900 --> 37:17.450
♪ Don't look back, keep walking ♪

37:18.240 --> 37:19.480
♪ Live or die, keep moving forward ♪

37:20.110 --> 37:21.690
♪ Through the fire ♪

37:22.750 --> 37:25.430
♪ Whose love ♪

37:26.740 --> 37:28.780
♪ Could be wider than the universe? ♪

37:29.850 --> 37:33.820
♪ It's ours ♪

37:40.570 --> 37:43.020
The Golden Dawn is complete now.

37:44.760 --> 37:47.180
As I expected,

37:47.800 --> 37:50.270
Red Eyes gave up on her life.

37:51.570 --> 37:52.860
I...

37:54.090 --> 37:55.410
haven't lost yet.

38:17.640 --> 38:18.710
Jiuhuo,

38:19.400 --> 38:21.780
think about what happened in the dungeon.

38:23.250 --> 38:26.000
Think about Jia Lan who died for you.

38:26.680 --> 38:28.720
Push the dragon blood out now.

38:28.740 --> 38:30.770
Don't be a disgrace!

38:32.210 --> 38:34.740
The Golden Dawn is waiting for you.
